    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by [ a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "load, the specific quantity of a substance which it is customary to load at one time; hence, taken as a unit of measure or weight for fletcher's timber (wood for making arrows) | the specific quantity of a substance which it is custumary to load at one time, a unit of measure of wood (OED s.v. load n. 2b), here of alabaster | load, the specific quantity of a substance (here: alabaster) which it is custumary to load at one time (OED s.v. load n. 2b) | meaning unknown | load, the specific quantity of a substance (here: wood) which it is custumary to load at one time, a unit of measure of wood (OED s.v. load n. 2b)" ;
